# designwithclaude.com

## Product Overview
- **Name:** Design with Claude
- **What it is:** A collection of 37 specialist design agents packaged as Claude Code slash commands
- **What it is not:** A SaaS product, a design tool with a GUI, a Figma plugin, or a generic AI prompt library
- **Who it's for:** Developers and designers using Claude Code who want expert-level design guidance in their coding workflow
- **Who it's not for:** Non-technical users looking for a visual design tool, or teams that don't use Claude Code

## Positioning
- **Category:** Developer tools / AI-assisted design
- **Core differentiator:** Deep, opinionated domain expertise in markdown files — not generic "help me design" prompting. Each agent contains structured knowledge (WCAG specifics, token architecture patterns, motion timing curves, compliance rules) that would take years to accumulate.
- **Competitive landscape:** Generic AI prompting, Copilot, Cursor rules. Design with Claude is the only product offering 37 specialized design domain agents as Claude Code commands.
- **Why this exists:** AI coding tools are great at code but lack design expertise. They produce generic, pattern-less UIs. These agents bridge the gap by giving Claude structured design knowledge.

## Context
- **Distribution:** Claude Code plugin (primary), standalone commands (copy to ~/.claude/commands/), project-local commands
- **Pricing:** Free, open source (MIT)
- **Tech stack:** No runtime. No dependencies. No API keys. Just markdown files.
- **Ecosystem:** Part of a design intelligence ecosystem with aiuxdesign.guide (36 AI UX patterns) and gist.design (structured design decision files)

## Features

### Design Brief (Master Command)
- **Intent:** Single entry point that analyzes a natural language brief, identifies relevant design domains (out of 37), and returns comprehensive guidance
- **Interaction model:** User describes what they're building → agent identifies relevant specialists → outputs token recommendations, component specs, layout decisions
- **Usage:** `/design-brief Build a SaaS analytics dashboard with dark mode and accessibility focus`

### Core Design Skills (4)
- **Visual Hierarchy Specialist:** Layout, spacing, focal points, content grouping
- **Interaction Designer:** User flows, states, gestures, feedback, keyboard patterns
- **Design System Architect:** Tokens, component APIs, variants, theming, governance
- **Accessibility Specialist:** WCAG compliance, ARIA, keyboard nav, screen readers

### Visual Design Skills (4)
- **Typography Specialist:** Type scales, font pairing, line height, vertical rhythm
- **Color Specialist:** Color palettes, contrast, dark mode mapping, semantic colors
- **Spacing & Layout Specialist:** Grid systems, spacing scales, density modes
- **Icon & Illustration Specialist:** Icon grids, sizing systems, SVG accessibility

### Interaction Skills (5)
- **Motion Designer:** Transitions, easing, timing, micro-interactions, reduced motion
- **Form Designer:** Form layout, validation timing, input types, multi-step forms
- **Navigation Specialist:** Sidebar, top bar, breadcrumbs, command palettes
- **Notification Designer:** Push notifications, toasts, badges, notification center
- **Drag & Drop Specialist:** Drag affordances, drop zones, reordering, canvas

### Product Skills (5)
- **Dashboard Designer:** KPI cards, data density, filters, real-time updates
- **Mobile Specialist:** Touch targets, thumb zones, gestures, offline states
- **Responsive Design Specialist:** Breakpoints, fluid typography, container queries
- **Landing Page Specialist:** Hero sections, CTAs, value propositions, conversion
- **Settings Designer:** Settings pages, preference architecture, toggle patterns
- **Auth & Security UX Specialist:** Login flows, 2FA/passkey, session management

### Content & IA Skills (3)
- **Content Strategist:** Microcopy, error messages, empty states, tone of voice
- **Information Architect:** Navigation structure, taxonomy, labeling, wayfinding
- **Conversational UI Designer:** Chat interfaces, bot personality, voice UI

### Industry Skills (4)
- **Healthcare UX Specialist:** Clinical workflows, HIPAA, patient data display
- **B2B SaaS Specialist:** Enterprise patterns, RBAC UI, multi-tenant, admin dashboards
- **E-commerce Specialist:** Product pages, filtering, image galleries, reviews
- **Checkout Specialist:** Cart UX, payment forms, guest checkout, trust signals

### Specialized Skills (8)
- **Dark Mode Specialist:** Dark surfaces, color remapping, elevation hierarchy
- **Error Handling Specialist:** Error messages, validation, recovery flows
- **Onboarding Specialist:** First-run experience, tooltip tours, feature discovery
- **Performance Specialist:** Skeleton screens, optimistic updates, lazy loading
- **Data Visualization Specialist:** Chart selection, axis design, color encoding
- **Table Designer:** Data tables, sorting, pagination, inline editing
- **Search Specialist:** Search UX, autocomplete, faceted filtering
- **Brand Designer:** Visual identity, logo usage, brand expression
- **Empty & Loading States Specialist:** Skeleton screens, empty states, loading patterns
- **Internationalization Designer:** RTL layouts, locale-aware UI, string expansion
- **Print & Export Designer:** PDF generation, print stylesheets, export UX
